<li>&lt;a href="%E1%AE%83%E1%AE%8A%E1%AE%AA%E1%AE%9E%E1%AE%9B%20%E1%AE%95%E1%AE%A8%E1%AE%8C%E1%AE%A7%E1%AE%94%E1%AE%AA"&gt;ᮃᮊ᮪ᮞᮛ ᮕᮨᮌᮧᮔ᮪&lt;/a&gt;, ᮅᮒᮙᮔ ᮓᮤ ᮜᮤᮀᮊᮥᮍᮔ᮪ &lt;a href="%E1%AE%95%E1%AE%9E%E1%AE%94%E1%AE%AA%E1%AE%92%E1%AE%A2%E1%AE%A6%E1%AE%94%E1%AE%AA"&gt;ᮕᮞᮔ᮪ᮒᮢᮦᮔ᮪&lt;/a&gt;, ᮊᮥ ᮃᮞᮥᮕ᮪ᮔ ᮃᮏᮛᮔ᮪ &lt;a href="%E1%AE%84%E1%AE%9E%E1%AE%A3%E1%AE%99%E1%AE%AA"&gt;ᮄᮞᮣᮙ᮪&lt;/a&gt; ᮒᮤ ᮒᮒᮁ ᮃᮛᮘ᮪,</li>
<li>&lt;a href="%E1%AE%83%E1%AE%8A%E1%AE%AA%E1%AE%9E%E1%AE%9B%20%E1%AE%9C%E1%AE%92%E1%AE%A4%E1%AE%94%E1%AE%AA"&gt;ᮃᮊ᮪ᮞᮛ ᮜᮒᮤᮔ᮪&lt;/a&gt;, ᮙᮤᮙᮤᮒᮤ ᮓᮤᮕᮊᮦ ᮃᮠᮤᮁ ᮃᮘᮓ᮪ ᮊ-|᮱᮹|, ᮓᮤᮝᮔᮧᮂᮊᮩᮔ᮪ ᮊᮥ ᮕᮀᮏᮏᮂ ᮝᮜᮔ᮪ᮓ,</li>
